        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<img src="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5368500?v=4" width="64" height="64" alt=""/><br/><p dir="auto">FF144 aligns with Chrome and Safari such that a cross origin iframe now requires sticky activation in order to redirect the top level page via <code class="notranslate">window.top.location</code> (in <a href="https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1419501" rel="nofollow">https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1419501</a>).</p>
<p dir="auto">This PR adds a release note and also a section in the iframe docs explaining the expected behavior as it is now.</p>
<p dir="auto">Related docs work can be tracked in <a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3417409664" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/41138" data-hovercard-type="issue" data-hovercard-url="/mdn/content/issues/41138/hovercard" href="https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/41138">#41138</a></p>]]></content>
